<title>UK: JP Morgan sets warrants on S.African Gilt.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan sets warrants on S.African Gilt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P.Morgan Jersey Ltd has issued a total of 20,000 American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Republic of South Africa R153 Gilt, lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 100,000 rand nominal value.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   22.APR.98		 PAYDATE	22.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE YIELD	 ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p> CALLS	   14.75 PCT	    3.55 PCT</p>
<p> PUTS	    14.75 PCT	    4.05 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	   </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
